msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whose words were those, again?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Di chi erano quelle parole?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5153D462_8E20_4E73_92F5_6A9666365CEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 751e92e27eb9a8f723aa6181576cd1548decfcee1d90c4d8d24514fca17c6195
#. default-sha256: 1ec5cbda7e1e92b933fc8a5bf2cd33b53176b3388623c0fd86dcf76f1377849e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5153D462_8E20_4E73_92F5_6A9666365CEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sh-⟪k:2⟫Shut your mouth!⟪k:3⟫How do you know about that?!⟪k:4⟫Were you eavesdropping?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C-⟪k:2⟫Chiudi quella fogna!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Come fai a saperlo?! Stavi ascoltando?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B5C8132_C8C1_409C_B893_DB04146A9987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9eab10f1359a3777095c71b772aa655186b38b18dccf01d76c26592e8ca4ff61
#. default-sha256: 0feec48a743ce03299f5691ee47f3c89a06ce187f5182fd76bb50be3358c662b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B5C8132_C8C1_409C_B893_DB04146A9987"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And another thing, I do ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ care for the sort of stupid, fantastical tales you "
"women so love to pass around!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E un’altra cosa, a me non frega ⟪k:1⟫niente⟪k:2⟫ degli stupidi racconti di fantasia che voi "
"donne amate tanto!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_70EA927F_8F4B_4247_AE42_F36AB2F4B422
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b03ddd26df254aac868b0c3b229481683567017de89de8c74b710e1e4044fab
#. default-sha256: 128a8020efbb817eb72f05c77bf2f78acac00e7c017fe9b841198352bc59ca63
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_70EA927F_8F4B_4247_AE42_F36AB2F4B422"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Because they ⟪k:2⟫scare you⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ahh, you’ve never been able to handle "
"anything scary, Jacopo."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché ti fanno ⟪k:2⟫paura⟪k:3⟫, forse?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ahh, sei sempre stato un cacasotto, "
"Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3BAFC4B4_AB08_4B21_9FA0_7F0E36ADA652
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9776d993bf7fca0c5f72456fa571f8066b1863e641be86b21c955ea267e97bbb
