msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CEB68370_2EDA_4E2D_A469_AD7736DAE434"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Whoa— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Don’t glare at me like that.⟪k:4⟫You’re gonna destroy my sides."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wooh— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non fissarmi in quel modo.⟪k:4⟫O mi ammazzerai dalle risate."

#: scenario3:scenario3_59273C73_B4B5_4B14_9178_4BCC5C45BE7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 390b8c683d9bd41040039b6e242774f6dce67de6de3c3d2c36592e3904a1aa01
