msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫......!!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫............!!!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8106A0DD_C724_4CD5_8560_B5285FBD84D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 747b48cbb5f77a6511fe39b24d1249507b7e823e606ed0f8b92508ed087a1867
#. default-sha256: 39f0d3b3ebcbe8753a91e121ea2390dac4d80c09f03265d46e9b250b8053a7df
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8106A0DD_C724_4CD5_8560_B5285FBD84D3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫...⟪k:2⟫...⟪k:3⟫...⟪k:4⟫...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫So.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"Did you come here for the sole purpose of telling me that cheap tripe?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫...⟪k:2⟫...⟪k:3⟫...⟪k:4⟫...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Allora,⟪k:12⟫ sei "
"venuta qui solo per raccontarmi queste stupidaggini da quattro soldi?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D165466E_04A8_429A_AC1F_CC190883006D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f883ca76860cedbace9020850a1b8b8a04c9893925df8035475869e0585cf82b
