msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A4E6FCF4_294C_4F4B_A592_B044693D09DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f486ac8032b0bb1b3951c6994cff6097bcd69b81d24d43f7c8203e6be335b015
#. default-sha256: 24f0f7add15ea19a770a81ec4b4c7ee1d85510158e10f2b0da29982c34a1acd5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A4E6FCF4_294C_4F4B_A592_B044693D09DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, I mean, I ⟪k:2⟫did⟪k:3⟫ make up a good half of it,⟪k:4⟫but the maid really did "
"hear a sound in the middle of the night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Okay, ammetto di essermi inventata buona parte della storia,⟪k:2⟫ma la domestica aveva "
"sentito davvero un suono nel bel mezzo della notte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c1eb486796601f0fee3397be8989bceff9dad23e2a3d672ec5706269aa453c7
#. default-sha256: 9050d5c7e06adfb2a69331dc3247fedb75b34e0c1e077874f51d2b0dfe2eb2a5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it came from the back hall of this very mansion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didja know, they say it used "
"to be a chapel?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E veniva dalla sala sul retro di questa stessa villa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sai cosa si dice? Che un "
"tempo fosse una cappella."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D94ECB6_FD6C_4BB6_9262_5446370A58B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8a709d10f0a113f037428badbd615bb985cbca1bff63706d5353c8cea17440d
#. default-sha256: 7669f8debac366fefde4a160ea0b2d293ad09c3d64561a5ba943344aaf048a4c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3D94ECB6_FD6C_4BB6_9262_5446370A58B1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Again, I have no interest in you women’s little ghost stories."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Te l’ho detto, non ho alcun interesse nelle storie di fantasmi di voi donne."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B689A9F5_9980_449B_8F17_4B428117F228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49051c170cc5f6406ef5f853ed441ce8bdc2341462ed08ce71291904536231de
#. default-sha256: aa5f4acdeebeef2fc923ad03ef3dfaf380fe572140508df4c427b23e64385964
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B689A9F5_9980_449B_8F17_4B428117F228"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Is ⟪k:2⟫thaaaat soooo⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You sure you’re not just scared?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ooooh, ⟪k:2⟫ma davvero⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sei sicuro di non essertela fatta sotto sul serio?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B13A4431_B46E_40D3_86AC_EB74589A6A1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de829cb0dc92ca75e62850645f10570ead6940d2cd565461a8706a3809684673
#. default-sha256: da4e7642fe065629bed41a61134496b79ef3f23230b5182c835ba1bc4241f59a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B13A4431_B46E_40D3_86AC_EB74589A6A1D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria!⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria!⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7412913b6565da5e4d879506efc9f580b082f0b289cb0f320838625ad0fe6ccc
#. default-sha256: 345b7aa6410da73e036b8f14d6b7a728bb3b61a1856bf8fcc2d72153cfae19ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, that said, the rumors aren’t completely unfounded.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This ⟪k:4⟫is⟪k:5⟫ a "
"pretty old mansion, and it’s had a lot of work done on it.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Kinda feels like it’s barely "
"holding itself together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Beh, le voci non erano completamente infondate.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Questa è una villa piuttosto "
"vecchia, dopotutto,⟪k:4⟫e l’hanno ristrutturata parecchie volte.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Pare che si reggesse a "
"malapena."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8A81ED2_FE20_44FE_B1D8_A91774CCA311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e564ffc25a83ce9f52fe7e135e6b821b923274f876d4d57577682940dbbcff2
#. default-sha256: 6d0578e80502a9f4d35da50724dd7e452cfd923bf46b2d717422dcaa8d46752a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8A81ED2_FE20_44FE_B1D8_A91774CCA311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Like a big old quilt with pieces from all different time periods."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Come una grande vecchia trapunta con toppe appartenenti a tante epoche diverse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 710b475b4f9961652e321555d2b86991643887311db0cf0789961ba66968ab55
#. default-sha256: d0864aa4f467940ceeff76d5270c03ce526270461ab7d0a38967ec3deffec9e7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The back hall is one of the oldest patches.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There’s a huge window on the far "
"end, and supposedly, there used to be stained glass in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E la sala sul retro è una delle toppe più antiche.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In fondo alla stanza c’è "
"un’enorme finestra,⟪k:4⟫dove si presume ci fosse una vetrata colorata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_03B616D1_F5BD_4EB4_93EA_963BCFEED59B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee647befd294c0df217e913b4011ca52c0496ff582456b73a7a3e5129222f9b2
#. default-sha256: 85820b2a6c430ae1a477b0d878742da86078fe3c62f7492f05622325d69e5c7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03B616D1_F5BD_4EB4_93EA_963BCFEED59B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a depiction of an archangel, they say.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Such a shame. I wonder when it was "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era la rappresentazione di un arcangelo, dicono.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che peccato.⟪k:3⟫ Chissà quando "
"è andata distrutta..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F386BA1D_CBE5_4CC4_8FA1_7CFD890B7DE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b70b666c59589d6b607243d652b1b1b3a57282d1b5d73c3952e25fba89cad547
#. default-sha256: 0cc96a5fa6101a37f3b241805ce25c8bdb5cf100e4b086a27d5bde82801ab420
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F386BA1D_CBE5_4CC4_8FA1_7CFD890B7DE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If it were still there, I bet it’d be worth a fortune!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se fosse ancora lì, scommetto che varrebbe una fortuna!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_959EFDB9_6DA3_4394_976F_ABA1BD83F487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3802ecd97c3b470703e5989e75f32f2f588380860fb7f675d86953ab9582142d
#. default-sha256: e3742800d1355bc2ab5ecf294fde082b9bf830ab7a4e966137f2c97a2f437723
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_959EFDB9_6DA3_4394_976F_ABA1BD83F487"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I find that hard to believe.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫First of all, why would anyone put a chapel "
"inside a mansion?"
msgstr ""
